Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(omnibrain): real orchestrator, registries, gates and
 test suite

- omni/: classifier, squad planner, parallel waves, retry/reassign/escalation,
  correction loop, arbitration, 6 validation gates, traceability, policy,
  shared memory with redaction, message bus, gitops safety rails, CLI
- registry/: 20 agent profiles, 30 verified skill sources, routing matrix for
  the 18 specialties, explicit per-agent tool permissions
- tests/: 63 unittest cases covering the 10 mandated scenarios
- OMNIBRAIN.md: replaced the unverifiable optimiser-mes-agents-IA reference
- docs/: reproducible GitHub audit (41 repos, 10 overwritten AGENTS.md),
  architecture, honest integration status

No AI provider is configured in this environment: runs end in NEEDS_WORK and
report executed=false rather than simulating an agent.
